  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FSP C-SAP4 Agrobiodiversity in-UNDP-CHN-00100218</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is part of an innovative programmatic approach to mainstream in-situ conservation of agrobiodiversity across China and reduce key threats to globally significant genetic resources for food and agriculture (GRFA). This project is designed to remove barriers currently restricting the protection and sustainable use of indigenous agricultural genetic diversity in Hubei Province, contributing towards achievement of the long-term objective of strengthening conservation of Hubei&#x2019;s globally</narrative>
  </description>
